2.
Definitions
. - In these regulations, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context -
(a)
'Act' means the Uttar Pradesh Secondary Education Services Commission Act, 1982;
(b)
'Committee' means a committee constituted by the Commission or the Chairman from amongst its members;
(c)
'Interview' includes viva-voce or personality test;
(d)
'Officer' means an officer of the Commission and includes the Secretary;
(e)
'Secretary' means the Secretary of the Commission.
